# milestone_0021 PR2: the V4-native installed agent owner (DESIGN sections 1-4,
# .spipe/simple_orchestrator/continuation_20261116/milestone_0021_agent_owner_v4/DESIGN.md).
# SOURCE_AUTHORED / NOT_RUN.
#
# One agent workload per service incarnation, preceded by its n provider probe
# workloads, all on the epoch's ONE lent transfer, strictly one after another.
# Each call advances at most one bounded step. This file owns the agent state,
# the invoke codec, the probe request, the stored-bytes gates (2-5), the
# section 4 checks, the stage drivers (3.4a, 3.4b), the Host settle (3.6) and
# the agent half of the staged close (3.7). The V4 service owner
# (HostLinuxServiceCurrentV4) holds it and supplies the borrowed Host
# capacity owner, the archived bytes and the live clock; this file never
# imports that owner (no import cycle). It opens no journal, reader, epoch or
# admission of its own, and its only Host progress write is the associated settle.
